<ans># Aditya Birla Health Insurance Co Ltd — Q1 FY25 (Quarter Ended 30 June 2024) Financial Data

## Sourcing Note

An attempt was made to retrieve the IRDAI "NL" quarterly public-disclosure return set for the period ended 30 June 2024 via the company's dedicated health-insurance financials/downloads page <doc_source>step1web1</doc_source>. However, the only public-disclosure PDF resolvable at the company's stated public-disclosure URL <doc_source>step6web1</doc_source> returned statutory NL-1 through NL-41 forms for the **quarter ended 31 December 2016** — a legacy filing, not the Q1FY25 (30-June-2024) statutory return.

Multiple targeted searches for the Q1FY25 NL-1/NL-2 disclosure PDF <doc_source>step2web1</doc_source> <doc_source>step3web1</doc_source> <doc_source>step4web1</doc_source> <doc_source>step5web1</doc_source> <doc_source>step9web1</doc_source> did not surface a live Q1FY25-dated NL disclosure document on the company's health insurance domain — the downloads/public-disclosure repository appears to host only the most current quarter, and the June-2024 filing was not indexable at the time of retrieval.

As a result, all **statutory IGAAP-only line items** exclusively disclosed via the NL return set (NWP, NEP, Expense of Management ratio, Net worth, Investments/AUM, Solvency ratio) are reported as **blank**, per the instruction to leave unpublished figures blank rather than estimate.

The **headline GWP / PBT / ratio figures** below are sourced from the company's Q1 FY25 Investor Presentation <doc_source>step7web1</doc_source>, corroborated by the Q1 FY25 Press Release <doc_source>step7web2</doc_source>, both dated 01-Aug-2024.

